# GMS's version is Sharp Eyes - Persist, which adds thirty seconds to the buff.
# Sharp Eyes is a permanent passive here, so there is no duration to extend, and
# it is renamed for the DEF it gives instead.
#
# That DEF is worth nothing, on purpose: DEF stops paying at a share of the
# attacking monster's attack, and a Bow Master passes that cap on their stats
# alone. See SkillEffect.def_pct. The Hero's Advanced Combo Attack - Barricade
# is the other such skill.
#
# Unlike the other two, this stays with the archer who bought it: it is not
# GMS's grant, so GMS's party rule doesn't apply.
name: "Sharp Eyes - Bulwark"
description:
  "Grants Sharp Eyes a bonus to DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BOW_MASTER skill_order: 4 }
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_MARKSMAN skill_order: 4 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
base { def: 1000 }
